        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Does Chatfuel have a permanent free plan?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "The pricing page checked on 28 October 2026 lists a seven-day free trial and paid plans; it does not list a permanent free plan. Trial details can change, so verify the current offer directly."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can I calculate one AI reply’s cost?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Not from a single flat per-reply figure. Usage depends on the model and actual consumption, and the provider’s current wallet terms determine deductions. Use your own billing data for an estimate."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Is Chatfuel cheaper than ManyChat?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "The listed subscription prices and limits differ, so a full comparison must include contact or conversation allowances, channels, credits, message charges, taxes and billing cycle."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can I move a Chatfuel bot to Chatora?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Chatora’s preview has no tested migration tool or migration service. Keep your original exports and confirm that any future importer is implemented and tested before planning a switch."
        }
      }
